{"conversation_hash": "a09b379519460e389802712d50a40793", "model": "gpt-3.5-turbo-0301", "timestamp": "2023-04-13 06:44:00+00:00", "conversation": [{"content": "Vscode如何配置springboot maven开发环境？", "country": "China", "hashed_ip": "33a628166cf67e90826b86d4cf88560f709336deabcdaea2a8e8f41c98b85174", "header": {"accept-language": "zh-CN,zh;q=0.9,en;q=0.8,en-GB;q=0.7,en-US;q=0.6", "user-agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/112.0.0.0 Safari/537.36 Edg/112.0.1722.39"}, "language": "Chinese", "redacted": false, "role": "user", "state": "Fujian", "timestamp": null, "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 135264}, {"content": "1. 首先需要安装最新版的Visual Studio Code（VScode），可以在官网上下载并安装：https://code.visualstudio.com/\n\n2. 安装Java开发套件插件，在VScode中点击插件图标（或快捷键Ctrl+Shift+X），搜索\"Java Extension Pack\"插件并安装。\n\n3. 下载并安装Maven，在Maven的官网上下载最新版本的Maven，并安装好后配置环境变量。可以在命令行中输入\"mvn -v\"命令测试是否安装成功。\n\n4. 在VScode中新建Maven项目，在VScode中依次点击File -> New Project -> Maven -> Quick Start，然后填写项目相关信息即可。创建好后可以在左侧的Explorer中看到项目目录结构。\n\n5. 编写代码并运行，在项目目录中找到src/main/java/下的Application.java文件，打开并编写代码。然后在命令行中进入项目目录，输入\"mvn spring-boot:run\"命令即可运行Spring Boot应用。\n\n以上就是综合使用VScode、Java、Maven创建和配置Spring Boot开发环境的步骤。", "country": null, "hashed_ip": null, "header": null, "language": "Chinese", "redacted": false, "role": "assistant", "state": null, "timestamp": "2023-04-13 06:43:18+00:00", "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 135264}, {"content": "给出详细步骤", "country": "China", "hashed_ip": "33a628166cf67e90826b86d4cf88560f709336deabcdaea2a8e8f41c98b85174", "header": {"accept-language": "zh-CN,zh;q=0.9,en;q=0.8,en-GB;q=0.7,en-US;q=0.6", "user-agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/112.0.0.0 Safari/537.36 Edg/112.0.1722.39"}, "language": "Chinese", "redacted": false, "role": "user", "state": "Fujian", "timestamp": null, "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 135267}, {"content": "好的，下面是详细的步骤：\n\n1. 安装VScode\n\n在官网上下载最新版的VScode，然后按照提示安装即可。\n\n2. 安装Java开发套件插件\n\n打开VScode，点击左侧的插件图标（或者使用快捷键Ctrl+Shift+X），在搜索框中输入\"Java Extension Pack\"，然后点击安装按钮。\n\n3. 安装Maven\n\n在Maven的官网上下载最新版本的Maven，然后按照提示安装即可。安装完成后，需要配置环境变量。在Windows系统中，可以在系统属性中的\"高级系统设置\"中设置环境变量。在\"系统变量\"中添加\"M2_HOME\"变量，值为Maven的安装路径，然后在\"Path\"变量中添加\"%M2_HOME%\\bin\"。\n\n4. 新建Maven项目\n\n在VScode中依次点击File -> New Project -> Maven -> Quick Start，然后填写项目相关信息，如下图所示：\n\n![新建Maven项目](https://img-blog.csdnimg.cn/20220103163412968.png)\n\n点击\"Generate\"按钮，等待项目生成完成。\n\n5. 编写代码并运行\n\n在VScode中打开项目，找到src/main/java/下的Application.java文件，然后编写Spring Boot应用的代码。例如，可以编写一个简单的RESTful API：\n\n```java\npackage com.example.demo;\n\nimport org.springframework.boot.SpringApplication;\nimport org.springframework.boot.autoconfigure.SpringBootApplication;\nimport org.springframework.web.bind.annotation.GetMapping;\nimport org.springframework.web.bind.annotation.RestController;\n\n@SpringBootApplication\n@RestController\npublic class DemoApplication {\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        SpringApplication.run(DemoApplication.class, args);\n    }\n\n    @GetMapping(\"/\")\n    public String hello() {\n        return \"Hello, World!\";\n    }\n}\n```\n\n然后在命令行中进入项目目录，输入\"mvn spring-boot:run\"命令即可运行Spring Boot应用。在浏览器中访问\"http://localhost:8080/\"，即可看到\"Hello, World!\"的输出。\n\n至此，你已经成功配置了Spring Boot开发环境，并编写了一个简单的RESTful API。", "country": null, "hashed_ip": null, "header": null, "language": "Chinese", "redacted": false, "role": "assistant", "state": null, "timestamp": "2023-04-13 06:44:00+00:00", "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 135267}], "turn": 2, "language": "Chinese", "openai_moderation": [{"categories": {"harassment": false, "harassment/threatening": false, "harassment_threatening": false, "hate": false, "hate/threatening": false, "hate_threatening": false, "self-harm": false, "self-harm/instructions": false, "self-harm/intent": false, "self_harm": false, "self_harm_instructions": false, "self_harm_intent": false, "sexual": false, "sexual/minors": false,