{"conversation_hash": "56620d3e78d0b42d0877bf4431dd2b00", "model": "gpt-4-0314", "timestamp": "2023-04-13 07:04:23+00:00", "conversation": [{"content": "opengl es中，我想在绘制时选择写入到指定的一个color buffer中，其它的color buffer保持不变，如何做到?", "country": "China", "hashed_ip": "cb4535a9bab9db434ab446e1fa8a05efa828b1a226fe9a3c28c6528e3b0887e0", "header": {"accept-language": "zh-CN,zh;q=0.9", "user-agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/112.0.0.0 Safari/537.36"}, "language": "Chinese", "redacted": false, "role": "user", "state": null, "timestamp": null, "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 135386}, {"content": "为了在OpenGL ES中选择写入到指定的一个color buffer中，我们可以使用glDrawBuffers接口定义帧缓冲区的颜色输出，将不同的输出通道关联到着色器的颜色输出变量（即FragData[0]，FragData[1]等）。\n\n这里是一个简单的示例，假设已经创建了一个帧缓冲区对象（FBO），并且附加了多个颜色目标（color attachment）：\n\n```cpp\nglBindFramebuffer(GL_FRAMEBUFFER, framebuffer);\n\n// 假设附加了3个颜色目标：GL_COLOR_ATTACHMENT0, GL_COLOR_ATTACHMENT1, GL_COLOR_ATTACHMENT2。\n// 若要仅写入到GL_COLOR_ATTACHMENT1，屏蔽其他附加点，请执行以下操作：\n\nGLenum colorBuffers[] = { GL_NONE, GL_COLOR_ATTACHMENT1, GL_NONE };\nglDrawBuffers(3, colorBuffers);\n\n// 开始绘制\n```\n\n在这段代码中，我们用GL_NONE禁用了其他颜色目标的写入。 接下来，将输出颜色写入到GL_COLOR_ATTACHMENT1，其它的color buffer保持不变。\n\n注意：在OpenGL ES 3.0及更高版本中支持glDrawBuffers，对于OpenGL ES 2.0，需要扩展GL_EXT_draw_buffers。 使用前确保检查设备是否支持此功能。", "country": null, "hashed_ip": null, "header": null, "language": "Chinese", "redacted": false, "role": "assistant", "state": null, "timestamp": "2023-04-13 07:04:23+00:00", "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 135386}], "turn": 1, "language": "Chinese", "openai_moderation": [{"categories": {"harassment": false, "harassment/threatening": false, "harassment_threatening": false, "hate": false, "hate/threatening": false, "hate_threatening": false, "self-harm": false, "self-harm/instructions": false, "self-harm/intent": false, "self_harm": false, "self_harm_instructions": false, "self_harm_intent": false, "sexual": false, "sexual/minors": false, "sexual_minors":